.* QUISECA: DSPSECA, the security attributes.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SAUID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SAGID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SASECLVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SAPWDLVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SASYSVAL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SACERT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SASTPWD CLASS=VALCL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
.* The labels that go on are indented with non-breaking blanks.
:PANEL NAME=DSPSECA HELP=HLPSECA KEYL=DSPKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Security Attributes
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=NO.
:DATACOL WIDTH=44.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=SAUID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SAUID'.User ID number
:DATAI VAR=SAGID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SAGID'.Group ID number
:DATAI VAR=SASECLVL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SASECLVL'.Security level
:DATAI VAR=SAPWDLVL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SAPWDLVL'.Password level
:DATAC.Allow change of security related system
:DATAI VAR=SASYSVAL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SASYSVAL'.  values
:DATAI VAR=SACERT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SACERT'.Allow add of digital certificates
:DATAC.Allow service tools user ID with default
:DATAC.  and expired password to change its own
:DATAI VAR=SASTPWD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SASTPWD'.  password
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSECA.Display Security Attributes - Help
:P.This display shows where the next generated user and group ID numbers
come from, the security and password levels, and the three security
choices dedicated service tools keep. CHGSECA changes the ID numbers;
CHGSYSVAL the levels; DST the choices.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SAUID'.User ID number
:P.The number the next user profile made without a UID gets: the start
CHGSECA set, skipping numbers in use, or one past the highest in use.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SAGID'.Group ID number
:P.The number the next group profile made without a GID gets, chosen the
same way.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SASECLVL'.Security level
:P.The QSECURITY system value.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SAPWDLVL'.Password level
:P.The QPWDLVL system value.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SASYSVAL'.Allow change of security related system values
:P.Whether the security system values may change. Only dedicated service
tools change this choice.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SACERT'.Allow add of digital certificates
:P.Whether certificates may be added to the certificate stores. Only
dedicated service tools change this choice.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SASTPWD'.Service tools user IDs with expired default passwords
:P.Whether a service tools user ID whose password is its default and has
expired may change its own password. Only dedicated service tools change
this choice.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
